# Keep the build context to what the image build needs: root workspace files,
# the shared/, server/ and web/ packages, the agent files (skills/ and the
# AGENTS.md block template) the server loads into the bundled layer, and the
# Help articles and the Workflow notes starter the web build bundles (docs/help,
# docs/templates/WORKFLOW-starter.md; BUILD_SPEC §5.17, §5.18).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.log
.git
.github
.claude
.specify
.vscode
.idea
docs/*
!docs/templates/AGENTS-tasklite.md
!docs/templates/WORKFLOW-starter.md
!docs/help
specs
# design/ is reference material, except the sample data the seed loader
# reads (T031, DOCKET_SEED=sample and `tasklite seed sample`).
design
!design/sample-data.json
docker/.env
.env
.env.*
